MASTER BUILD PROMPT: XAU PILOT

Premium Multi-EA MT5 Automated Trading Platform

Act as a senior Android engineer, fintech software architect, backend engineer, MQL5 integration specialist, database architect, cybersecurity engineer and premium UI/UX designer.

Your task is to design and build a production-oriented Android application and supporting backend platform for a commercial automated trading software service.

The working project name is XAU Pilot. The final commercial brand name must remain configurable as "[FINAL BRAND NAME]".

Do not build a basic trading dashboard or a static UI prototype. Build a modular, scalable application with real authentication architecture, database models, API integration, EA management workflows, licensing, configuration management, account isolation, and secure MT5 connectivity.

Where external services or credentials are unavailable, implement clear integration interfaces and labelled demo functionality. Never pretend that an external service is connected when it is not.

