1. PRODUCT VISION

Build a premium Android application that allows customers to:

1. Register and manage their accounts.
2. Connect multiple MetaTrader 5 accounts.
3. Browse a marketplace containing multiple Expert Advisors.
4. Purchase monthly, annual or lifetime EA licences.
5. Install EAs using customer-hosted MT5 or XAU Pilot managed VPS hosting.
6. Assign different EAs to different MT5 accounts.
7. Run multiple compatible EAs across their authorised accounts.
8. Adjust EA inputs remotely through the mobile application.
9. Monitor EA activity and account status.
10. View open positions, pending orders, trade history and performance statistics.
11. Pause, resume and control their EAs remotely.
12. Manage account-wide and EA-specific risk settings.
13. Manage VPS hosting, subscriptions, licences, notifications and support.

The platform must support multiple customers independently. Each customer's accounts, EAs, configurations, licences, trades, positions, commands and hosting resources must be isolated.

The platform must not operate as a broker or hold customer trading funds.

Customers trade through their own broker accounts.

The initial release must prioritise DEMO trading. LIVE trading must remain disabled until the appropriate security, legal, operational and broker approvals have been completed.

